kindCellsT -- THE TWO += CELLS NO FIXTURE HAD REACHED, PINNED AS THEY BEHAVE TODAY
(Amendment 2 to FINISH +=, 2026-09-25). Run with INCANT_PEQ_PROBE=1 so each fire
names the opPlusEQ branch it took; the rows read that name between the MARK pair.

C4   a dataless NODE += onto an EMPTY field (pick step 4): branch F, the node is
     appended -- length 1.
C1n  a node += onto a BIN (pick step 1): branch C, appended -- length 2.
C1c  a COUNT += onto the same bin: branch C again, appended -- length 3. A bin
     carries isSET, its DERIVED set, and it does not count as a data kind.

When the structural member lands, the branch column stops reading C/F and these
rows re-pin to the member's name; the lengths must not move.
